messages.content:
Analyze the Jira bug report title and description and the seed changes that were made to fix the reported bug. Combine this analysis with the initial static impact set, which contains the fully qualified names of code entities that are statically related to the seed changes.
For each entity in the initial static impact set, analyze its relationship to the seed changes and collect evidence indicating whether the entity must be modified as a consequence of the seed changes.  Furthermore, identify any additional code entities that must be modified or created and collect supporting evidence.
Focus on production code, not test code or other files.
Inputs: - Jira bug report title: Ivy default cache path with Umlauts lets it crash. - Jira bug report description: I'm trying to build the Solr 4 beta. When ivy tries to fetch the dependencies into the cache, I get the following message:

	io problem while parsing ivy file: http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/commons-codec-1.6.pom: Path contains invalid character: ä
		module not found: commons-codec#commons-codec;1.6
	==== local: tried
	 C:\Users\Jochen Schäfer\.ivy2/local/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/ivys/ivy.xml
	 -- artifact commons-codec#commons-codec;1.6!commons-codec.jar:
	 C:\Users\Jochen Schäfer\.ivy2/local/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/jars/commons-codec.jar
	==== shared: tried
	 C:\Users\Jochen Schäfer\.ivy2/shared/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/ivys/ivy.xml
	 -- artifact commons-codec#commons-codec;1.6!commons-codec.jar:
	 C:\Users\Jochen Schäfer\.ivy2/shared/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/jars/commons-codec.jar
	==== public: tried
	 http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/commons-codec-1.6.pom
	==== sonatype-releases: tried
	 http://oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/releases/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/commons-codec-1.6.pom
	 -- artifact commons-codec#commons-codec;1.6!commons-codec.jar:
	 http://oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/releases/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/commons-codec-1.6.jar
	==== working-chinese-mirror: tried
	 http://mirror.netcologne.de/maven2/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/commons-codec-1.6.pom
	 -- artifact commons-codec#commons-codec;1.6!commons-codec.jar:
	 http://mirror.netcologne.de/maven2/commons-codec/commons-codec/1.6/commons-codec-1.6.jar
		::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::
		:: UNRESOLVED DEPENDENCIES ::
		::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::
		:: commons-codec#commons-codec;1.6: not found
		:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: - Seed changes and their Git diff hunks: [{"fqn": "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.PomReader(java.net.URL,org.apache.ivy.plugins.repository.Resource)", "git_diff_hunk": "@@ -93,0 +92,2 @@ public class PomReader {
+ InputSource source = new InputSource(stream);
+ source.setSystemId(XMLHelper.toSystemId(descriptorURL));
@@ -95 +95 @@ public class PomReader {
- Document pomDomDoc = XMLHelper.parseToDom(stream, res, new EntityResolver() {
+ Document pomDomDoc = XMLHelper.parseToDom(source, new EntityResolver() {
@@ -112,6 +112,4 @@ public class PomReader {
- if (stream != null) {
- try {
- stream.close();
- } catch (IOException e) {
- // ignore
- }
+ try {
+ stream.close();
+ } catch (IOException e) {
+ // ignore"}] - Initial static code change impact set: ["org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomModuleDescriptorParser.parseDescriptor(org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.ParserSettings,java.net.URL,org.apache.ivy.plugins.repository.Resource,boolean)", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.1.1()", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.AddDTDFilterInputStream.AddDTDFilterInputStream(java.io.InputStream)", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.MODEL", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.PARENT", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.PROJECT", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.getFirstChildElement(org.w3c.dom.Element,java.lang.String)", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.parentElement", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.parser.m2.PomReader.projectElement", "org.apache.ivy.plugins.repository.Resource.getName()", "org.apache.ivy.util.XMLHelper.getDocBuilder(org.xml.sax.EntityResolver)", "org.apache.ivy.util.XMLHelper.parseToDom(java.io.InputStream,org.apache.ivy.plugins.repository.Resource,org.xml.sax.EntityResolver)", "org.apache.ivy.util.url.URLHandler.openStream(java.net.URL)", "org.apache.ivy.util.url.URLHandlerRegistry.getDefault()"]

Expected output:
Structured evidence for each entity of the initial static impact set, including: - its fully qualified name - an assessment of whether it must be modified as a consequence of the seed changes - the supporting evidence
Additionally, include any code entities that must be modified or created but are not part of the initial static impact set.
